      "title": "Why The Trade Desk Fell 16% in June",
      "summary": "The Trade Desk stock fell 16% in June amid concerns about slowing revenue growth and increased competition from tech giants like Google, Amazon, and Meta that are leveraging AI to strengthen their advertising platforms. The departure of the Chief Revenue Officer after seven months added to investor concerns, though the company did resolve a dispute with Publicis and could benefit from the Fox-Roku merger.",
